-- LABELS NEEDED FOR SAME-TYPE PARAMETERS ----------------------- main.kl  K1104

This exported function has two neighbouring parameters of the same type, so a call by position could swap them without any error. Their arguments need labels.

4│     let r = transfer(1, 2, 3)
               ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^

Try: `to: `

Try: `amount: `

Help: Label the arguments with the parameter names, for example `transfer(from: a, to: b)`. `kalam fix` inserts the labels.

Learn more: kalam explain K1104
